12 (cake)
+43 (presents) = 55
+15 (decorations) = 70
+4 (invitations) = 74
+22 (goodie bags) = 96. Yep, that's correct.

So total is $96 divided by 3 people equals $32 each. That seems right. Each person, including Isabelle and her two parents, pays $32.
