After the administrators, there are remaining seats. How many are left? If total is 72 and 18 are taken, then 72-18=54. So 54 seats left. 

Now, it says one-third of the remaining seats were occupied by parents. The remaining seats were 54, so one-third of those. Let me calculate that. 54 divided by 3. 54÷3=18. Wait, so parents took 18 seats. 

