Then the problem says Reggie ran 3 miles farther than Lynn. So Reggie's distance is Lynn's distance plus 3 miles. So if Reggie ran 20 miles, then Lynn ran 20 minus 3. Let me check that. Oh right, because Reggie's distance is 3 more than Lynn's. So Lynn ran Reggie's distance minus 3. So 20 minus 3 is 17. So Lynn ran 17 miles?

