"Kimberly bought 8 packages of cat food and 6 of dog food. Each package of cat food contained 11 tins, and each of dog food contained 6 tins. How many more tins of cat food than dog food did Kimberly buy?","Kimberly bought 8 packages of cat food and 6 packages of dog food. Each package of cat food contained 11 tins, and each package of dog food contained 6 tins. How many more tins of cat food than dog food did Kimberly buy?",52,52,52,52,"Kimberly bought 8 packages of cat food, each containing 11 tins.  
Total tins of cat food = 8 × 11 = 88.  
