"Vince can staple 30 reports every 15 minutes. If he stapled reports from 8:00 AM until 11:00 PM, how many did he staple altogether?","Vince can staple 30 reports every 15 minutes. If he was stapling reports from 8:00 AM until 11:00 PM, how many reports did he staple altogether?",360,360,180,180,"Vince works from 8:00 AM to 11:00 PM, which is a total of 15 hours. He can staple 30 reports every 15 minutes. 

