Now, for the boys. It says one-fourth of the boys are on varsity. There are 12 boys. One-fourth of 12 is 3, because 12 divided by 4 is 3. So 3 boys are on varsity. Then the boys not on varsity would be 12 minus 3, which is 9 boys.

